From: EglantinePS5 <noreply@eglantineps5.local>
Subject: [PATCH] shader: EDEN_NX2_TENSOR_ONLY must not veto Ocarina's title default

EDEN_NX2_TENSOR_ONLY lists the HMMA programs the lowering admits. Patch 0205 moved the list check
after upstream's title_tensor default, so a list left in a console's env.txt vetoes the default it
was meant to narrow. The release ships no env.txt, but the console's copy cannot be edited, and its
list (ad0) is exactly the ten NDVE movie-filter offsets 43c0, 1eb0, 790, 3440, 9f0, 2c40, ef0, 9a0,
1bb0 and b30 that Ocarina lowers by default: a console log shows all ten rejected with "native
matrix multiply (not in EDEN_NX2_TENSOR_ONLY)", each followed by "Upscale fallback target ...
0/3597 non-zero, 0 changes" - the plain upscale stand-in, rendering them black.

Skip the list for title_tensor. An explicit EDEN_NX2_TENSOR still narrows to the list for other
titles, and EDEN_NX2_TENSOR_BACKGROUND (shipped default) builds the programs off the frame path, so
the ~12 s Configure hold the list was avoiding does not come back.

Checked: reverse-applies on the core plus the 0205/0203/0187/0204/0178/0051 stack; the stack plus
this patch applies to 0ca2032bff with none failing. Not run on a console.

---
diff --git a/src/shader_recompiler/frontend/ampere/lower_to_maxwell.h b/src/shader_recompiler/frontend/ampere/lower_to_maxwell.h
--- a/src/shader_recompiler/frontend/ampere/lower_to_maxwell.h
+++ b/src/shader_recompiler/frontend/ampere/lower_to_maxwell.h
@@ -1623,11 +1623,16 @@
             // The others stay rejected, so they keep the stand-in. Ocarina of Time: ad0 is the one
             // program outside its movie library; the movie filter NDVE is 43c0, 1eb0, 790, 3440,
             // 9f0, 2c40, ef0, 9a0, 1bb0 and b30, close to a plain copy on nxnative (#1375).
+            // The list must not veto title_tensor, the title's own default: the console's env.txt
+            // cannot be edited, so a stale EDEN_NX2_TENSOR_ONLY there rejects exactly the ten NDVE
+            // programs this title lowers, and the plain upscale stand-in renders them black
+            // ("Upscale fallback target ... 0/3597 non-zero"). An explicit EDEN_NX2_TENSOR still
+            // narrows to the list for other titles.
             static const std::string tensor_only = [] {
                 const char* const text = std::getenv("EDEN_NX2_TENSOR_ONLY");
                 return text ? "," + std::string{text} + "," : std::string{};
             }();
-            if (!tensor_only.empty() && !hmma_program_listed) {
+            if (!tensor_only.empty() && !hmma_program_listed && !title_tensor) {
                 const std::string offset = fmt::format(",{:x},", index * sizeof(Instruction));
                 if (tensor_only.find(offset) == std::string::npos) {
                     return fail(index, "native matrix multiply (not in EDEN_NX2_TENSOR_ONLY)");
